"ant-radio-input\" value=\"2\" style=\"\"><span class=\"ant-radio-inner\"></span></span><span>全部房间定时转脏<span>系统将在每日6：00后将全部房间自动转脏</span></span></label></div><div class=\"ant-space-item\" style=\"\"><label class=\"ant-radio-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"ant-radio-input\" value=\"3\" style=\"\"><span class=\"ant-radio-inner\"></span></span><span>在住订单定时转脏（酒店适用）<span>房间有入住中的订单，系统将在每日6:00后自动转脏</span></span></label></div><div class=\"ant-space-item\" style=\"\"><label class=\"ant-radio-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"ant-radio-input\" value=\"4\" style=\"\"><span class=\"ant-radio-inner\"></span></span><span>退房日订单定时转脏（民宿适用)<span>房间有退房日期为当天的订单，系统将在每日6:00后自动转脏</span></span></label></div><div class=\"ant-space-item\"><label class=\"ant-radio-wrapper\"><span class=\"ant-radio\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"ant-radio-input\" value=\"5\" style=\"\"><span class=\"ant-radio-inner\"></span></span><span>订单办理退房后变脏<span>当订单办理退房后，系统立即将房间自动转脏</span></span></label></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"smartItem___x2n4M\"><div class=\"title___g-jWF\"><div class=\"titleText___338Fv\">房间转净策略</div></div><div class=\"content___3m3_7\"><div class=\"switch___3WLW_\"><span>保洁任务完成后房间自动转净</span><button type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"ant-switch ant-switch-checked\"><div class=\"ant-switch-handle\"></div><span class=\"ant-switch-inner\"></span></button></div></div></div></div>"
